//? Title: Mark-and-sweep object-graph liveness
//? Subtitle: Actual root traversal, complete old-slot classification and the original cyclic garbage
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Mark-and-sweep separates root-reachable objects from unreachable ones, including
unreachable cycles. We retain the original eight-object graph, expose actual
canonical root/pop/reference events and every real sweep decision, and
distinguish reclaimable object identities from a physical C++ deallocation or
allocator implementation.
)

\toc

> Tiny root discovery and sweep

Marking starts with every supplied root. Mark an object at the moment it is
pushed, so duplicate roots, duplicate fields and cycles cannot push it twice.
Pop pending objects LIFO and examine their original ordered fields,
marking/pushing each newly discovered target. After the stack empties, scan
every original object slot and append its id to either the live or reclaimable
result according to its actual mark.

For three objects with root0 and field0-to1, objects0 and1 are live and object2
is unreachable. The table records the actual stack/mark events, while the
diagram selects the real root discovery, real child discovery and returned
partition. The liveness trace is emitted inside the same canonical producer used
by both collector models and reachable_from_roots; no second traversal
manufactures an explanation.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mark_sweep_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto t = dm::algorithms::mark_sweep_trace({3, {{1}, {}, {}}, {0}, {}});
    std::print("| actual event0:root,1:pop,2:field | actual object | actual owner or minus1 | actual " "original slot or SIZE_MAX | previously marked | actually pushed | actual stack before | " "actual stack after |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (auto &e : t.marking.events)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", int(e.kind),
                   e.object, e.parent, e.slot, e.already_marked, e.pushed,
                   e.stack_before, e.stack_after);
    auto it =
        std::find_if(t.marking.events.begin(), t.marking.events.end(), [](auto &e) {
        return e.kind == dm::algorithms::ObjectMarkEventKind::Reference &&
            e.pushed;
    });
    dm::graphics::Diagram d;
    d.node("root", {0, 0},
           std::format("Actual root discovery\nobject{} pushed{}",
                       t.marking.events.front().object,
                       t.marking.events.front().pushed)).node(
        "child", {6, 0},
        std::format("Actual field discovery\nowner{} to object{}", it->parent,
                    it->object)).node("sweep", {12, 0},
                                      std::format("Actual complete sweep\nlive{}, reclaimable{}",
                                                  t.analysis.result.live.size(),
                                                  t.analysis.result.freed.size())).edge("root", "child").edge("child", "sweep");
    d.save_svg("build/mark_sweep_tiny.svg");
}
```
